              "content": "Fixed: glyphs were off-centre (x16 in a body spanning 10 to 86); the radial had overlapping wedges and an inner radius smaller than the node, so the node punched through it. Added: the display halo (D-3), the role-based silhouette system (D-10, sheet 06-06), and the status row under the node name (D-11). See 06-07 for the full amendment log.",
