              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Fidelity fix: round 1 depicted node types that do not exist (boolean, displace, mountain, smooth) and a subdivide scheme param that was deliberately removed from the product. Every node type and parameter in this file is now checked against the 33-type registry in crates/solarxy-graph/src/nodes/.",
