              "id": "sW3Rt",
              "x": 16,
              "y": 30,
              "name": "n",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "content": "BODY  112 x 32, the one layout box (D-26/D-27).\nSilhouette by role (D-10), fill = category;\nthe root roles are one 96x28 pill. Glyph 16px\ninked directly at the box centre, no plate.",
              "lineHeight": 1.4,
              "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
              "fontSize": 9,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "d36We",
              "x": 16,
              "y": 140,
              "name": "n",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "content": "BYPASS WING  visual 10px, hit area 18 x 54\n(overshoots the body so it stays clickable\nat low zoom). Burnt orange #E07A3F when on.",
              "lineHeight": 1.4,
              "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
              "fontSize": 9,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "xOlIO",
              "x": 16,
              "y": 250,
              "name": "n",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "content": "DISPLAY HALO  148px disc behind the node in\n#58a6ff. The only cue readable from across\nthe graph, and Solarxy has no OUT node:\nany node can hold the flag.",
              "lineHeight": 1.4,
              "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
              "fontSize": 9,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "qNdAs",
              "x": 640,
              "y": 30,
              "name": "n",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "content": "DISPLAY WING  the click target and the local\ncue. Halo + wing together = Houdini's two-part\ntreatment. Exclusive per subflow (radio).",
              "lineHeight": 1.4,
              "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
              "fontSize": 9,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "K5lJIF",
              "x": 640,
              "y": 130,
              "name": "n",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "content": "LABEL STACK (D-11)\ntype label  9px grey, zoom >= 0.7\nname        12px, always\nstatus row  error / warn / bypass / stale / count\nparam line  9px blue, from the existing infoLine\ndescription 10px teal, only if authored\n            AND zoom >= 0.9",
              "lineHeight": 1.4,
              "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
              "fontSize": 9,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "YN0ju",
              "x": 640,
              "y": 270,
              "name": "n",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "content": "HANDLES float clear of the box (3px gap),\nkeeping DataType colour + shape. One axis\nfor every silhouette (D-26/D-27); only the\ngather dome rides above the box, and its\ninputs cross it. Nothing but the glyph and\nwings ever sits ON the body.",
              "lineHeight": 1.4,
              "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
              "fontSize": 9,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "path",
              "id": "poHI0",
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "name": "leads",
              "geometry": "M215 45l115 90m-115 20l77-3m-77 110l85-72m336-145l-226 100m226 5l-216 5m216 125l-266-85",
