          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 900,
          "content": "F1 takes the material node from about ten params to thirty-plus. The existing tab strip is a single non-wrapping row, so one tab per property family (Base, Transmission, Clearcoat, Sheen, Iridescence, Specular, Anisotropy, Maps) overflows a 420px panel. The resolution is fewer, broader tabs with labelled subsections inside them, which keeps the established underline-tab idiom and adds no new widget.",
