                      "id": "nQbNq",
                      "name": "b",
                      "fill": "$text-tertiary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The panel holds the same anchors the row carries, in order. Tab traverses them; choosing one closes the panel and moves to the section.",
