    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "f4Grnl",
      "x": 7000,
      "y": 36900,
      "name": "06-10 One geometric contract (0.8.2)",
      "theme": {
        "gen": "evo"
      },
      "fill": "$background-primary",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 18,
      "padding": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "HYt9S",
          "name": "Sheet title",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "content": "One geometric contract (0.8.2)",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 18,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ahYmm",
          "name": "cap",
          "fill": "$text-tertiary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 940,
          "content": "The canvas ships four body sizes, two silhouettes with a tab carved out of the box, and a hand-tuned offset that re-centres the glyph but not the ring around it. The resolution is one LAYOUT BOX, 112x32 for every role, with three rules. The visible body sits centred inside the box and may be smaller: size stays a meaning channel (light 96x28 the fixture, text 76x26 the quiet datablock, terminal the 28 donut), exactly the precedent the terminal component set. Risers ride ABOVE the box the way the gather dome always has: the container folder tab and the camera viewfinder bump move out of the box, restoring the full 32px body and killing the compensating offset by construction. And one origin: glyph, cook arc, display halo, terminal core and selection all centre on the box centre, which now equals the body centre for every role. QA REVISION (D-27, below): the tab and bump were withdrawn in the maintainer's QA round; the root roles ship as the 96x28 fixture pill, glyphs ink directly on the body, and the mothers beside this caption show the shipped state.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "l04dE0",
          "name": "New mothers",
          "gap": 90,
